/v1/","context":{"app_id":4692500,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4692500-1836506165572030","game_id":"steam-4692500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.33: Rank Assessment!","summary":"Hi everyone! A new update for the No One Returns demo is officially live. The biggest addition in this patch is the brand-new Rank Assessment feature at the end of the demo! Now you can see exactly how well you performed and try to improve your score. I've also spent a lot of time tweaking the zombie AI so they chase you further, and made the boss fight a bit more dynamic.Here are the details of what is new in v0.33:HighlightsEnd of Demo Rank Assessment: When you complete the demo, you will now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T07:25:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165572030","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4692500-1836506165553461","game_id":"steam-4692500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.32b - Realistic Blood, Difficulty Selection, and new AI Boss!","summary":"Hello everyone!I've just pushed a massive new update (v0.32b) to the No One Returns demo! This patch focus heavily on combat realism, improving enemy boss AI, adding features like difficulty selection, and optimizing the game's overall file size.Here are the patch notes for v0.32b:Visuals & Immersion UpgradesRealistic Blood Splashes: Combat feels much more visceral now with overhauled, realistic blood effects during fights.Explosive Physics: Added realistic dead body launching physics when enemi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T10:44:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165553461","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4692500-1835871199308610","game_id":"steam-4692500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.30 - Explosive Barrels, Tank Tuning, and Bug Fixes!","summary":"Hello everyone!A new update (v0.30) is now live for the No One Returns demo! This patch introduces some explosive new tactical options to help you deal with the threats in the city, alongside a variety of highly requested bug fixes.Here are the patch notes for v0.30:New Features & Gameplay AdjustmentsExplosive Barrels Added: You can now find explosive barrels scattered around the environment. Use them wisely to take out groups of enemies and save your precious ammunition!Friendly Fire Tank: Adju","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T02:34:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199308610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4692500-1835236783565107","game_id":"steam-4692500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.26h - Better Combat, Smarter Zombies, and a Special Live Stream!","summary":"Hello everyone!Thank you so much to everyone who has played the No One Returns demo and shared your feedback. I have been working hard to make the game feel even better, and I am excited to release the new v0.26h Update today!Before we get to the patch notes, I have a fun community announcement!🔴 Special Live Stream This Sunday! If you want to see the new update in action, the awesome streamer Nietschiy will be playing the No One Returns demo live on Twitch!When: Sunday, June 14th at 7:00 PM (Be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T02:27:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783565107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4692500-1834602721189349","game_id":"steam-4692500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Faster Threats, Visibility Fixes, and a Brand-New Trailer!","summary":"Thank you for playing the No One Returns demo over this past week! Your gameplay videos and detailed feedback gave us exactly what we needed to make the experience tighter, scarier, and smoother.We have spent the last seven days pushing out a massive patch based directly on your reports. The update is live right now!🎥 Watch the New TrailerBecause the pacing and lighting have completely changed, we have cut a brand-new trailer featuring updated gameplay and a faster pace.The new trailer: https://","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T03:22:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721189349","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4692500-1833968530889898","game_id":"steam-4692500","kind":"announcement","title":"The City is Silent. The Demo is Live","summary":"The world is dead silent, and the demo for No One Returns is finally here. Groovy Zebra Studio is excited to invite you to step into Denis’s shoes.Your Feedback Is Needed! Please drop by the Steam Community Forums or join our official Discord Server to let us know how the combat feels, how the performance held up on your machine, and what you want to see in the full release. Even if you just want to drop in and say hi, you are always welcome!If you enjoy the demo, adding the game to your Wishlis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T02:06:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889898","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4692500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4692500":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4692500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4771690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:39:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4692500","app_id":4692500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:47Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5e1a43828a89a171548d399f2b65fb994fedada7d94d981b6fe6e7132e8808c0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Have you ever wondered what happens if you wake up and everyone is simply gone? No One Returns is a third-person survival horror game. Play as Denis, search a chillingly silent city for clues about your missing family while fighting the frightening zombies swarming the streets.","publishers":[{"name":"Groovy Zebra Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46005601}],"developers":[{"name":"Groovy Zebra Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46005601}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Demo Trailer - No One Returns","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1782653999","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4692500/990090410/857828c4ba6c02f19f22a94c9ddc06f870f455d1/1782653749/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filena